Drumming and dancing will begin January 27th 2015 and there will be a NEW hub of African drumming on the Sunshine Coast. Tuesday nights will be your night of action and class times and prices will be emailed out in January closer to the start date. Students that are already drumming with us will receive a short survey for this years drumming and we would love your feedback, comments and suggestions for 2015. If you are interested in joining us next year, please drop us an email,so we can pop you on the class list. Look forward to seeing you all again for an exciting year of performances, parties and most of all drumming!
